  "memorial_details": "Small granite stone of remembrance with squadron badge at top\n\nThis memorial is placed here, on/ the 50th anniversary of the crash,/ to commemorate the crew members/ who died.",
  "inscription": "In the early hours/of March 4th, 1945/ Lancaster PB 476 (PH \"Y\") of No. 12 Squadron/R.A.F. Wickenby,/ crashed near this spot,/ the victim of/ a Luftwaffe intruder./ This memorial is placed here, on/ the 50th anniversary of the crash,/ to commemorate the crew members/ who died./ Fg Off Nicholas Agnew Ansdell/ Fg Off Alfred Gordon Heath/ Fg Off Alexander Hunter/ Sgt William Mellor/ Sgt R O Parry/ Sgt R F D Schafer/ Sgt A R Walker/ IN GRATEFUL REMEMBRANCE",
